- `magic-api/.../core/service/impl/DefaultMagicResourceService.java#L501-L568`: `saveFile()`

- `magic-api/.../core/service/MagicResourceStorage.java#L41-L57`: Request body format = `JSON + "\r\n=================================\r\n" + script`

